# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Safety first: this is a PUBLIC repo. Nothing project-specific may land here.
#
# A review report describes a *user's own* codebase — table names, column
# names, schema. That is their (or their client's) confidential data and must
# never be committed here, even by accident while developing the skill itself.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Generated review reports (named <author>.sql-review.<date>.md)
*.sql-review.*.md

# A project-local rule layer, if one gets written while testing here
.claude/sql-review-rules.md

# Scratch
*.tmp
*.bak
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
